{"id":"pistola","lemma":"pistola","pos":"adj","rank":2646,"glosses":["pissed off, mad, aggressively angry"],"ipa":"/pisˈtɔ.lɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/94/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-pistola.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ela atirou nele com uma pistola.","en":"She shot him with a pistol.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to throw","l":"atirar"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"Não há balas nesta pistola.","en":"There aren't any bullets in this pistol.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"bullet, projectile","l":"bala"},null,null]},{"text":"Tom disparou a pistola três vezes.","en":"Tom fired the pistol three times.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to shoot, to fire","l":"disparar"},{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"three"},{"g":"times"}]},{"text":"Ele armou-se de uma pistola.","en":"He armed himself with a pistol.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to arm","l":"armar"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"O Tom ficou pistola.","en":"Tom went ballistic.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},null]}]}